                        2990 --350:  [Overview]\n
                        2991 --351:  "icum" sub-menu
                        2992 --353:  [Description]\n
                        2993 --354:  "icum" sub-menu entry
                        2994 --355:  The following function names are expanded by the VRUN_USR_CMD macro.\n
                        2995 --356:     const char CMD_USR_4 [] = "icum";\n
                        2996 --357:     void vrun_cmd_usr_4 (void)\n
                        2997 --358:  The above function is called from the vrun module according to the selection 
                        2998 --359:  from the main menu.
                        2999 --361:  In this function, the submenu screen is displayed, and the target service is 
                        3000 --362:  displayed from the numerical value entered according to the screen.\n
                        3001 --363:  Call a function group that describes sample code that uses a command.
                        3002 --365:  [Parameters]\n
                        3003 --366:  None
                        3004 --368:  [Return value]\n
                        3005 --369:  None
                        3006 --370: */
